1
00:00:11,277 --> 00:00:15,178
This is Part 6 of 6, a
draft: Five elements,

2
00:00:15,258 --> 00:00:17,478
five lights, rainbow body.

3
00:00:18,289 --> 00:00:23,403
This is After Anatta: notes by
John Tan, known as Thusness.

4
00:00:24,234 --> 00:00:26,410
Before anything else, a note.

5
00:00:26,490 --> 00:00:30,336
This part is a draft, and I do
not wish it to be published yet.

6
00:00:30,416 --> 00:00:34,317
It comes from my own
contemplation, over many years.

7
00:00:34,397 --> 00:00:37,537
I have not read these links
put this way anywhere else.

8
00:00:37,617 --> 00:00:41,437
And I do not claim that this is
how orthodox Dzogchen states them.

9
00:00:41,517 --> 00:00:45,431
So please read it as my
contemplation, to be tested.

10
00:00:45,511 --> 00:00:47,474
Not as a teaching of the tradition.

11
00:00:48,297 --> 00:00:52,021
It is simply where many years
of refinement have brought me:

12
00:00:52,101 --> 00:00:54,073
to see how these things are linked.

13
00:00:54,153 --> 00:00:58,991
What makes the links visible, for
me, is holding three things together.

14
00:00:59,071 --> 00:01:02,035
The history: how the Indian five elements,

15
00:01:02,115 --> 00:01:07,211
the Chinese five, and the five lights
came to sit side by side in Tibet.

16
00:01:07,291 --> 00:01:10,703
The method of practice:
trekchö and thögal,

17
00:01:10,783 --> 00:01:13,257
and the logic that unties the habit.

18
00:01:13,337 --> 00:01:18,017
And the view: dependent arising,
with emptiness never a ground.

19
00:01:18,829 --> 00:01:22,893
That is why I made the videos on
inner winds and the subtle body,

20
00:01:22,973 --> 00:01:26,222
and on the five elements,
Chinese and Tibetan.

21
00:01:26,302 --> 00:01:28,300
And the five parts before this one.

22
00:01:28,380 --> 00:01:31,520
If we live in the wisdom
of dependent arising,

23
00:01:31,600 --> 00:01:34,306
something more can be recognised in time.

24
00:01:34,386 --> 00:01:38,885
The elements the apple was held to
are recognised as the five lights.

25
00:01:38,965 --> 00:01:41,307
That is what the rainbow body is about.

26
00:01:41,397 --> 00:01:44,650
For me, this is where the
pieces fall into place.

27
00:01:45,449 --> 00:01:48,254
So let me go step by step, from the apple.

28
00:01:49,066 --> 00:01:50,753
Step one, the apple.

29
00:01:50,833 --> 00:01:52,696
Toss an apple and catch it.

30
00:01:52,776 --> 00:01:55,182
It feels like one solid thing, out there.

31
00:01:55,262 --> 00:01:59,815
But where exactly is it? Is it the
red I see? The press on my palm?

32
00:01:59,895 --> 00:02:02,016
The weight, the arc through the air?

33
00:02:02,096 --> 00:02:06,595
Is it any one of these, all of them
together, or something behind them?

34
00:02:06,675 --> 00:02:09,802
Look for that solid apple,
and it is never found.

35
00:02:09,882 --> 00:02:13,090
What is there is hardness, coolness, red,

36
00:02:13,170 --> 00:02:15,549
weight, and the arc of the toss.

37
00:02:15,629 --> 00:02:18,909
They are met together, and
designated as one thing.

38
00:02:19,742 --> 00:02:23,942
The apple still works perfectly
in the hand. It follows gravity.

39
00:02:24,022 --> 00:02:28,317
Yet it has no apple-ness inside
it, and no substrate under it.

40
00:02:28,397 --> 00:02:32,203
And the hardness and the motion
are not a bottom layer either.

41
00:02:32,283 --> 00:02:37,669
They are designated too. That is
dependent arising, in one ordinary moment.

42
00:02:38,477 --> 00:02:40,829
Step two, the five elements.

43
00:02:40,909 --> 00:02:46,005
Those same qualities are the elements,
read the Indian way. Earth is hardness.

44
00:02:46,085 --> 00:02:47,518
Water is cohesion.

45
00:02:47,634 --> 00:02:51,495
Fire is heat. Wind is
motion. And space is room.

46
00:02:51,575 --> 00:02:54,837
In the old Buddhist
analysis, the Abhidharma,

47
00:02:54,917 --> 00:02:57,690
they are already properties, not stuff.

48
00:02:57,770 --> 00:03:00,177
So the elements are not a second topic.

49
00:03:00,257 --> 00:03:03,265
They are the apple's
appearings, given names.

50
00:03:04,089 --> 00:03:05,965
Step three, the habit.

51
00:03:06,045 --> 00:03:08,492
What makes them seem solid is the knot.

52
00:03:08,572 --> 00:03:12,636
It is the habit of tying those
appearings into one thing out there,

53
00:03:12,716 --> 00:03:14,715
and into one body in here.

54
00:03:14,795 --> 00:03:18,153
Dzogchen describes the same
moment from the other side.

55
00:03:18,233 --> 00:03:22,242
The display, not recognised,
is taken as other,

56
00:03:22,322 --> 00:03:24,448
and hardens into the elements.

57
00:03:24,537 --> 00:03:27,433
From the elements come
the body and the world.

58
00:03:27,513 --> 00:03:31,106
So the ordinary body is
light not recognised.

59
00:03:31,909 --> 00:03:34,125
Step four, the five lights.

60
00:03:34,205 --> 00:03:36,965
Untie the knot, and nothing is lost.

61
00:03:37,045 --> 00:03:41,584
Hardness, warmth and motion
remain, vivid and unowned.

62
00:03:41,664 --> 00:03:46,937
That vivid, unfound appearing is
what Dzogchen calls the five lights.

63
00:03:47,017 --> 00:03:49,741
The elements, recognised as display.

64
00:03:50,561 --> 00:03:52,872
Step five, the rainbow body.

65
00:03:52,952 --> 00:03:56,146
That recognition, carried
all the way through,

66
00:03:56,226 --> 00:04:01,989
the body included, is the rainbow body
in its essence. It is a realization.

67
00:04:02,069 --> 00:04:04,792
What happens to the corpse is only a sign.

68
00:04:05,613 --> 00:04:08,291
So the apple is the whole path in small.

69
00:04:08,371 --> 00:04:11,796
Holding the apple solid
is where saṃsāra starts.

70
00:04:11,876 --> 00:04:15,293
Seeing through it is where
the rainbow body begins.

71
00:04:16,118 --> 00:04:17,900
The key is the middle step.

72
00:04:17,980 --> 00:04:22,057
The habit that makes the apple solid
is the same habit that makes the lights

73
00:04:22,137 --> 00:04:24,123
harden into the elements.

74
00:04:24,203 --> 00:04:28,633
So the wisdom of dependent
arising, which undoes that habit,

75
00:04:28,713 --> 00:04:31,432
is not a different path
from the rainbow body.

76
00:04:31,512 --> 00:04:33,828
It is the beginning of the same path.

77
00:04:34,650 --> 00:04:38,497
Put the apple beside the five
lights, and they are one movement,

78
00:04:38,577 --> 00:04:40,182
described twice.

79
00:04:40,262 --> 00:04:43,252
What Dzogchen calls the
display taken as other,

80
00:04:43,332 --> 00:04:47,818
condensing into elements and a
solid body, is what I call the knot.

81
00:04:47,898 --> 00:04:50,494
It is the habit of the inherent framework,

82
00:04:50,574 --> 00:04:54,000
tying separate appearings
into one thing out there.

83
00:04:54,080 --> 00:04:58,388
As if hardness, red and sweetness
belonged to a hidden core.

84
00:04:58,468 --> 00:05:02,573
In the five aggregates, the knot
is the formations aggregate.

85
00:05:02,653 --> 00:05:05,268
It is the grasping that
hardens the lights.

86
00:05:06,081 --> 00:05:08,827
Untie the knot, and nothing is lost.

87
00:05:08,907 --> 00:05:13,718
Just this hardness, this red,
this coolness, this sweetness.

88
00:05:13,798 --> 00:05:17,142
Vivid, appearing as their
conditions come together.

89
00:05:17,222 --> 00:05:22,522
That is the apple seen as display: many
unmixed streams of vivid appearing,

90
00:05:22,602 --> 00:05:26,571
with nothing owning them. Dzogchen
would say the five lights.

91
00:05:26,651 --> 00:05:29,660
I say: just this, vivid and light.

92
00:05:30,469 --> 00:05:33,785
Now, what reasoning can
show, and what it cannot.

93
00:05:33,865 --> 00:05:36,693
Steps one to three can
be checked by reasoning.

94
00:05:36,773 --> 00:05:38,391
The apple is not found.

95
00:05:38,471 --> 00:05:40,715
The elements are qualities of appearing.

96
00:05:40,795 --> 00:05:43,541
And the habit is what
ties them into a thing.

97
00:05:43,621 --> 00:05:48,011
Steps four and five are a matter
of realization, not argument.

98
00:05:48,091 --> 00:05:50,891
Reasoning can point to
them. It cannot test them.

99
00:05:50,971 --> 00:05:53,921
That is why I hold this
section as contemplation,

100
00:05:54,001 --> 00:05:55,950
to be tested in practice.

101
00:05:56,766 --> 00:06:00,423
Why does the wisdom of
dependent arising come first?

102
00:06:00,503 --> 00:06:03,126
Because the habit is
what hardens the lights,

103
00:06:03,206 --> 00:06:06,904
and the habit is exactly
what that wisdom undoes.

104
00:06:06,984 --> 00:06:12,203
So living in it is not a step beside the
rainbow body. It is the way towards it.

105
00:06:12,283 --> 00:06:16,591
While we still think, analyse
and orient ourselves inherently,

106
00:06:16,671 --> 00:06:20,586
the elements stay solid, however
much we hear about light.

107
00:06:20,666 --> 00:06:23,833
When appearing is seen
as dependent arising,

108
00:06:23,913 --> 00:06:28,765
vivid and unfindable, the solidity
has nothing left to rest on.

109
00:06:28,845 --> 00:06:32,017
Then the recognition of
the lights becomes natural.

110
00:06:32,829 --> 00:06:35,126
Dzogchen has two practices here.

111
00:06:35,206 --> 00:06:39,270
Trekchö, cutting through,
frees the mind from grasping.

112
00:06:39,350 --> 00:06:43,768
Thögal, direct crossing,
recognises the appearing side,

113
00:06:43,848 --> 00:06:46,431
the display, through and through.

114
00:06:46,511 --> 00:06:48,985
Both are the same knot coming untied.

115
00:06:49,065 --> 00:06:53,052
Once from the side of the mind, and
once from the side of appearance.

116
00:06:53,857 --> 00:06:56,875
And this is why the view
of Dzogchen becomes clear.

117
00:06:56,955 --> 00:07:01,440
Without dependent arising, its words
are easily heard the wrong way.

118
00:07:01,520 --> 00:07:04,320
The five lights sound
like a shining substance.

119
00:07:04,400 --> 00:07:07,269
The ground sounds like a
source they condense out of.

120
00:07:07,349 --> 00:07:11,046
The rainbow body sounds like
a body turning into light.

121
00:07:11,126 --> 00:07:14,596
And practice sounds like
unfreezing frozen energy.

122
00:07:15,426 --> 00:07:18,920
With dependent arising, every
one of these falls away.

123
00:07:19,000 --> 00:07:24,626
The essence of the ground is primordial
purity, ka dag. That is, emptiness.

124
00:07:24,706 --> 00:07:27,371
Longchenpa calls it a groundless ground.

125
00:07:27,451 --> 00:07:30,591
The lights are its display,
with nothing behind them.

126
00:07:30,671 --> 00:07:34,327
Condensing into the elements
names how appearing is taken,

127
00:07:34,407 --> 00:07:36,229
not a stuff turning solid.

128
00:07:36,309 --> 00:07:41,882
And spontaneous presence is dependent
arising seen without the habit of fixing.

129
00:07:41,962 --> 00:07:43,566
It is never uncaused.

130
00:07:43,646 --> 00:07:47,371
So nothing condenses, and
nothing needs to be unfrozen.

131
00:07:47,451 --> 00:07:51,329
There was only a deep habit
of seeing in an inherent way.

132
00:07:52,150 --> 00:07:56,187
So each word has a way it is
misheard, and a way it is seen.

133
00:07:56,267 --> 00:08:01,174
Dependent arising is misheard as
a web or a machine behind things.

134
00:08:01,254 --> 00:08:04,720
Seen, it is the wisdom
that unties the knot.

135
00:08:04,800 --> 00:08:08,388
The five elements are misheard
as five kinds of stuff.

136
00:08:08,468 --> 00:08:10,983
Seen, they are qualities of appearing.

137
00:08:11,063 --> 00:08:15,059
The five lights are misheard as
a luminous substance underneath.

138
00:08:15,139 --> 00:08:20,073
Seen, they are the clarity of
appearing, as empty as what appears.

139
00:08:20,153 --> 00:08:23,456
And the rainbow body
is misheard as a goal.

140
00:08:23,536 --> 00:08:25,730
Seen, it is a realization.

141
00:08:26,560 --> 00:08:28,685
Four guards keep this from going wrong.

142
00:08:29,543 --> 00:08:31,682
First, the lights are not a stuff.

143
00:08:31,812 --> 00:08:36,610
"The aggregates are made of light" is
easily heard as light lying underneath

144
00:08:36,690 --> 00:08:38,987
them. That is a substrate again.

145
00:08:39,068 --> 00:08:42,031
Clarity is the knowing
clarity of appearing,

146
00:08:42,111 --> 00:08:45,944
never absent, and as
empty as everything else.

147
00:08:46,024 --> 00:08:49,694
The five lights name that
clarity in five qualities.

148
00:08:49,774 --> 00:08:53,720
The error is lifting it out of what
appears, and making it a thing.

149
00:08:54,538 --> 00:08:57,257
Second, nothing returns to a source.

150
00:08:57,337 --> 00:09:01,714
Recognising the lights is not
going back into a luminous ground.

151
00:09:01,794 --> 00:09:03,290
Nothing is produced either.

152
00:09:03,370 --> 00:09:07,515
When the conditions that kept the
elements coarse no longer come together,

153
00:09:07,595 --> 00:09:10,776
the coarse body no
longer appears as coarse.

154
00:09:10,856 --> 00:09:12,900
That is dependent arising too.

155
00:09:13,745 --> 00:09:16,478
Third, the colour tables are maps.

156
00:09:16,558 --> 00:09:21,532
Which element goes with which colour,
aggregate or wisdom changes from text to

157
00:09:21,612 --> 00:09:26,424
text. Any single table is one
lineage's pairing for practice.

158
00:09:26,504 --> 00:09:29,118
It is not a chart of what
the world is made of.

159
00:09:30,001 --> 00:09:32,556
Fourth, it is not the measure of insight,

160
00:09:32,636 --> 00:09:34,404
and not a goal to grasp.

161
00:09:34,484 --> 00:09:37,434
Insight is measured by
the freedom of the mind,

162
00:09:37,514 --> 00:09:39,513
not by what happens to the body.

163
00:09:39,593 --> 00:09:42,692
Many great masters left ordinary bodies.

164
00:09:42,772 --> 00:09:46,959
To practise for a body of light is
still to practise for something.

165
00:09:47,039 --> 00:09:50,247
The reports of bodies
shrinking cannot be checked.

166
00:09:50,327 --> 00:09:54,191
And a shrinking body is not
by itself a rainbow body.

167
00:09:54,993 --> 00:09:58,214
So the thread runs one
way, and it is one seeing.

168
00:09:58,294 --> 00:10:02,019
The wisdom of dependent
arising unties the habit.

169
00:10:02,099 --> 00:10:04,695
The elements are no longer held as solid.

170
00:10:04,775 --> 00:10:07,318
They are recognised as the five lights.

171
00:10:07,398 --> 00:10:10,212
And that recognition, all the way through,

172
00:10:10,292 --> 00:10:12,535
is what the rainbow body means.

173
00:10:12,615 --> 00:10:15,692
In essence, a realization, not a goal.

174
00:10:16,501 --> 00:10:19,559
All views and understanding
here are my own,

175
00:10:19,639 --> 00:10:21,991
from my practice and contemplation.

176
00:10:22,071 --> 00:10:26,054
I do not represent any
tradition, school or teacher.

177
00:10:26,134 --> 00:10:29,102
And this part, once more, is a draft.

178
00:10:29,934 --> 00:10:33,496
Pick up an apple, or just
picture one. Feel its weight.

179
00:10:33,576 --> 00:10:37,422
Look for the solid apple behind
the red and the press on your palm.

180
00:10:37,502 --> 00:10:41,584
It is not found, and the apple
is still right here, working.

181
00:10:42,418 --> 00:10:44,961
That one moment holds the whole thread.

182
00:10:45,041 --> 00:10:47,560
If you think you understand
it, keep looking.

